          %p
            By the discussion at
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+string+structure"} differential string structure
            we have that the top morphism is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fibration"} fibration
            in the global projective
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+structure+on+simplicial+presheaves"} model structure on simplicial presheaves
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
