          #NatureOfGaugedCSForm.num_note
            %h6#note_3 Note
            %p
              In the literature often the relative
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Simons+form"} Chern-Simons form
              is considered for “ungauged” paths of connections: for
