          %h2#References References
          %h3#general General
          %p
            The C-field in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D11+supergravity"} D=11 supergravity
            originates as the
            = succeed "-field" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi A
                      %mrow
                        %mi μ
                        %mi ν
                        %mi ρ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A_{\mu\nu\rho}
          %ul
            %li#CremmerJuliaScherk78
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eugene+Cremmer"}> Eugene Cremmer
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bernard+Julia"} Bernard Julia
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jo%C3%ABl+Scherk"} Joël Scherk
              = succeed "," do
                %em Supergravity in theory in 11 dimensions
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0370-2693(78)90894-8"} doi:10.1016/0370-2693(78)90894-8
          %p
            Re-derivation in the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%27Auria-Fr%C3%A9+formulation+of+supergravity"} D'Auria-Fré formulation of supergravity
          %ul
            %li#DAuriaFre82
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"}> Riccardo D'Auria
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/GeometricSupergravity.pdf", :title => "Geometric Supergravity in D=11 and its hidden supergroup"} Geometric Supergravity in D=11 and its hidden supergroup
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(82)90376-5"} doi:10.1016/0550-3213(82)90376-5
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/GeometricSupergravityErrata.pdf", :title => "errata"} errata
          %p Review in:
          %ul
            %li#CastellaniDAuriaFre
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Leonardo+Castellani"}> Leonardo Castellani
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riccardo+D%27Auria"} Riccardo D'Auria
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pietro+Fr%C3%A9"} Pietro Fré
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Supergravity+and+Superstrings+-+A+Geometric+Perspective"} Supergravity and Superstrings - A Geometric Perspective
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andr%C3%A9+Miemiec"}> André Miemiec
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Schnakenburg"} Igor Schnakenburg
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Basics of M-Theory
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0509137"} arXiv:hep-th/0509137
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1002/prop.200510256"} doi:10.1002/prop.200510256
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/shifted+C-field+flux+quantization+condition"} shifted C-field flux quantization condition
            was originally proposed in
          %ul
            %li#Witten96a
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On Flux Quantization In M-Theory And The Effective Action
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9609122"} arXiv:hep-th/9609122
            %li#Witten96b
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Five-Brane Effective Action In M-Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9610234"} arXiv:hep-th/9610234
          %p
            Proposals to model the condition by a
            = succeed "-shifted" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wu+class"} Wu class
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+differential+cohomology"} ordinary differential cohomology
          %ul
            %li#DiaconescuFreedMoore03
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Duiliu-Emanuel+Diaconescu"}> Duiliu-Emanuel Diaconescu
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dan+Freed"} Dan Freed
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Greg+Moore"} Greg Moore
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  The
                  = succeed "-theory" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi M
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} M
                  = succeed "-gauge" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msub
                            %mi E
                            %mn 8
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E_8
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Haynes+Miller"} Haynes Miller
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Douglas+Ravenel"} Douglas Ravenel
              (eds.)
              = succeed "," do
                %em Elliptic Cohomology Geometry, Applications, and Higher Chromatic Analogues
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0312069"} arXiv:hep-th/0312069
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511721489"} doi:10.1017/CBO9780511721489
          %p picked up e.g. in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ron+Donagi"}> Ron Donagi
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Martin+Wijnholt"} Martin Wijnholt
              %em The M-Theory Three-Form and Singular Geometries
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.05838"}> arXiv:2310.05838
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            A related model of the C-field in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nonabelian+bundle+2-gerbe"} nonabelian
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bundle+2-gerbes"} bundle 2-gerbes
          %ul
            %li{:id => "AschieriJurčo04"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paolo+Aschieri"}> Paolo Aschieri
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Branislav+Jur%C4%8Do"} Branislav Jurčo
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Gerbes, M5-Brane Anomalies and
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi E
                          %mn 8
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E_8
                  Gauge Theory
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0409200"} arXiv:hep-th/0409200
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1088/1126-6708/2004/10/068"} doi:10.1088/1126-6708/2004/10/068
          %p
            Further discussion ofthe
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+anomaly"} quantum anomaly
            of the supergravity C-field, and its cancellation:
          %ul
            %li#FreedMoore04
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dan+Freed"}> Dan Freed
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Greg+Moore"} Greg Moore
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Setting the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+integrand"} quantum integrand
                  of M-theory
              %strong 263
              1 (2006) 89-132, &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0409135"}> arXiv:hep-th/0409135
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-005-1482-7"} doi:10.1007/s00220-005-1482-7
          %p A summary and review of this:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Greg+Moore"}> Greg Moore
              ,
              %em Anomalies, Gauss laws, and Page charges in M-theory
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0409158"}> arXiv:hep-th/0409158
              )
          %p
            The discussion in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+differential+c-structures"} twisted nonabelian differential cohomology
            is given in
          %ul
            %li#FSS12
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Domenico+Fiorenza"}> Domenico Fiorenza
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
